From: Matteo Geromin <geromin.matteo@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:26:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/17] Add some AM335x PWM defines

Add the PWMSS1 / eCAP1 / ePWM1 base addresses.

The rest of the 2015 patch (EPWM_CLK_EN/EPWM_CLK_STOP_REQ and the ePWM
register layout, now struct pwmss_epwm_regs) is already upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm/include/asm/arch-am33xx/hardware_am33xx.h | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-am33xx/hardware_am33xx.h b/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-am33xx/hardware_am33xx.h
index de597c2775f..e02b95f7927 100644
--- a/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-am33xx/hardware_am33xx.h
+++ b/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-am33xx/hardware_am33xx.h
@@ -73,4 +73,8 @@
 #define AM33XX_ECAP0_BASE		0x48300100
 #define AM33XX_EPWM_BASE		0x48300200
 
+#define PWMSS1_BASE			0x48302000
+#define AM33XX_ECAP1_BASE		0x48302100
+#define AM33XX_EPWM1_BASE		0x48302200
+
 #endif /* __AM33XX_HARDWARE_AM33XX_H */
